; 	src[*]: {CHILDREN}
; 		[default][*]: {CHILDREN}
; 			X.java[+]: {}> ;   but was:<P[*]: {CHILDREN | CONTENT}
; 	src[*]: {CHILDREN}
; 		[default][*]: {CHILDREN}
; 			X.java[+]: {}
; 	ResourceDelta(/P/src)[*]>; which would tell me that a cu was added but a non-java resource delta was also ; generated.

